  "instructions": [
    "Preheat the oven to 180°C.",
    "In a large mixing bowl, whisk together the goats cheese, sour cream, honey, lemon juice, eggs, ginger, cinnamon and salt until smooth.",
    "Pour the mixture into a molcajete or heatproof bowl.",
    "Bake in the preheated oven for 45 minutes, or until the pudding is set and slightly caramelised.",
    "Remove from the oven and let cool to room temperature.",
    "Refrigerate for at least 2 hours to chill."
